OL,3,ACould an iced coffee freeze you out of
OL,4,Athe job market?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWould you bring an iced coffee to a job
OL,7,Finterview?
OL,9,FThe question on the internet's lips
OL,10,Fthis week started life, as many do, in
OL,11,Fa TikTok video.
OL,13,F"Don't waltz into your interview all
OL,14,Fcasual with an iced coffee, it just
OL,15,Flooks like you didn't have time to
OL,16,Ffinish your coffee beforehand," said US
OL,17,Frecruiter Caitlin Wehniainen.
OL,19,FIt's what her Gen Z job candidates are
OL,20,Fdoing, she said, warning it makes it
OL,21,Flook like the interview is "just a stop
OL,22,Fon your list of errands for the day".
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
